@startuml post_creation_flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Segoe UI, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowout false

skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #64748B
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
    ArrowColor #475569
    ArrowFontSize 10
}

skinparam activityDiamond {
    BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
    BorderColor #D97706
    FontColor #92400E
}

title **Modern Laravel Blog - Author Dashboard: Post Creation & Alpine.js Flow**

|#EFF6FF|Author (Browser & Alpine.js)|
|#F0FDF4|Auth Middleware & Gate|
|#FEFCE8|DashboardPostController|
|#FAF5FF|Storage (Public Disk) & SQLite DB|

|Author (Browser & Alpine.js)|
start
:Author clicks "+ Write New Post" in Dashboard / Navbar;
:Navigate to **GET /dashboard/posts/create**;

|Auth Middleware & Gate|
:Verify **auth** & **verified** middleware;
if (Is Authenticated?) then (no)
    |Author (Browser & Alpine.js)|
    :Redirect to **/login** with intended URL preserved; <<#FEE2E2>>
    stop
else (yes)
    |Auth Middleware & Gate|
    :Check **Gate::authorize('create', Post::class)**;
    
    |DashboardPostController|
    :Fetch categories list:\n""Category::orderBy('name')->get()"";
    :Render view **dashboard.posts.create**;
    
    |Author (Browser & Alpine.js)|
    :Initialize Alpine.js scope:\n""x-data="{ title, slug, imagePreview, generateSlug() }""";
    
    :Author types article title into\n**<input x-model="title" @input="generateSlug()">**;
    :Alpine.js auto-converts title to kebab-case slug\nand updates **x-model="slug"** in real-time;
    
    if (Author selects optional featured image?) then (yes)
        :Alpine.js **FileReader** loads Data URL\nand renders dynamic image preview thumbnail;
    else (no)
        :Keep fallback placeholder icon;
    endif
    
    :Author selects Category & types Body content;
    :Author clicks "Publish Article" button;
    :Submit form via **POST /dashboard/posts**\nwith CSRF Token (**@csrf**) and multipart encoding;

    |Auth Middleware & Gate|
    :Verify CSRF Token (**VerifyCsrfToken** middleware);
    :Verify **Gate::authorize('create', Post::class)**;

    |DashboardPostController|
    :Execute Form Request Validation:
    - **title**: required | string | max:255
    - **slug**: required | string | max:255 | alpha_dash | unique:posts,slug
    - **category_id**: required | exists:categories,id
    - **body**: required | string
    - **image**: nullable | image | mimes:jpeg,png,jpg,webp,gif | max:2048;

    if (Validation Rules Passed?) then (no - Invalid)
        |Author (Browser & Alpine.js)|
        :Redirect back to create form with:\n- Validation error bag ($errors)\n- Preserved inputs via old(); <<#FEE2E2>>
        stop
    else (yes - Valid)
        |DashboardPostController|
        if ($request->hasFile('image')?) then (yes)
            |Storage (Public Disk) & SQLite DB|
            :Store file on public disk:\n""$path = $request->file('image')->store('posts', 'public')"";
            :Generate unique hashed filename:\n""posts/abc123xyz.webp"";
            |DashboardPostController|
            :Set **$validated['image'] = $path**;
        else (no)
            |DashboardPostController|
            :Set **$validated['image'] = null**;
        endif

        |Storage (Public Disk) & SQLite DB|
        :Associate post with authenticated author:\n""$request->user()->posts()->create($validated)"";
        :Insert new record into **posts** table in SQLite;

        |DashboardPostController|
        :Flash success message to session:\n""with('success', 'Article published successfully!')"";
        :Redirect to **route('dashboard.posts.index')**;

        |Author (Browser & Alpine.js)|
        :Render **dashboard.posts.index** with new post;
        :Alpine.js triggers auto-dismissing flash banner\n(""x-data="{ show: true }" x-init="setTimeout(() => show = false, 4000)""); <<#DCFCE7>>
        stop
    endif
endif

@enduml
